message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Melbourne Parking Occupancy Dataset"
abstract: >-
  1.41 million half-hourly occupancy observations for 536 kerbside parking zones in Melbourne, Australia, from 18 September 2026. The City of Melbourne publishes the current status of 6,324 in-ground bay sensors and no history at all; this dataset is the missing time axis. Derived from City of Melbourne On-street Parking Bay Sensors, licensed CC BY 4.0.
authors:
